# Optional public main-site link, compiled into the SaaS web bundle.
# HTTPS URL in deployed builds. Local Vite development also permits literal
# http://127.0.0.1, http://localhost, or http://[::1] (with an optional port).
# Never include credentials, query parameters, or fragments.
# Leave empty to hide main-site links. Use an environment-specific site URL.
VITE_CLAWHUNT_SITE_URL=
